    "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Weekend PRN!&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Advanced Center for Nursing and Rehab </span>is seeking a Full Time <span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Physical Therapy Assistant/PTA</span>&nbsp;to help patients improve their mobility and move forward. Ideal candidates will possess a CT license or be in the process of obtaining CT licensure and will have experience working in the skilled nursing environment.&nbsp;<span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">New Grads are welcome to apply!</span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Responsibilities</span></p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #595959; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 0.625rem !important;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Implement selected components of care and interventions in a technically competent manner</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Instruct and counsel patients effectively in exercises</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Identify patient&rsquo;s needs and exhibit compassion, caring, and empathy for individual differences</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Recommend options, courses of action, or modifications in selected treatments ensure patient&rsquo;s progress, safety, and comfort</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Apply the latest research related to restoring function, reducing symptoms frequency, and preventing injury</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Complete documentation to support the delivery of physical therapy services</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Perform selected data collection and obtain accurate information</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Measure performance and report on patient&rsquo;s medical record</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Participate in patient status judgments</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Adhere to ethical and legal standards</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Ensure continued competence and updated field knowledge</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Skills</span></p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #595959; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 0.625rem !important;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Proven working experience as a physical therapist assistant</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Excellent knowledge of physiology best practices and standards</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Hands-on experience with therapeutic exercises, functional training and physical modalities</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Ability to communicate and instruct effectively</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Healthcare administration and documentation skills</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">License to practice or relevant certification</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Career Advantages:</span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong>&middot; Rare in-house opportunity- NOT CONTRACTED!&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1